Domestic file for Pennsylvania stations in the PA QSO Party (2026 rules, section 10.a)
In-state multipliers: the 67 PA counties, the ARRL sections, the Canadian sections and one DX.
The sponsor's exchange is a serial plus a PA county, an ARRL section, a Canadian section or DX (5.a),
so the section list arrlsect.dom is included, not the states and provinces of S50.DOM and P13.DOM.
No line of this header may hold an equals sign: the reader takes any such line as an entry.

INCLUDE FILE pa_cty.dom
INCLUDE FILE arrlsect.dom
dx = dx
